</style>
	</div>
	
<div class="row"  id="row-1087851484">

	<div id="col-793313527" class="col small-12 large-12"  >
				<div class="col-inner"  >
			
			
	<div id="text-3606405866" class="text">
		
<h2>Your Local, High Quality &#038; <span class="lightblue">Responsive Builder</span></h2>
		
<style>
#text-3606405866 {
  font-size: 1.4rem;
}
@media (min-width:550px) {
  #text-3606405866 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
  }
}
@media (min-width:850px) {
  #text-3606405866 {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
  }
}
</style>
	</div>
	
<p><strong>Rise Residential Ltd is an owner-operated Professional &amp; Experienced Christchurch Builder based in Canterbury that specialises in all forms of residential construction including renovations, new builds and property maintenance. We employ experienced people who are friendly, courteous and produce good quality results that we can be proud of.</strong></p>
<p>At Rise Residential we believe in such basics as professionalism, honesty and integrity. We provide open, clear lines of communication with our clients, and maintain strict schedules and deadlines. We pride ourselves in the high quality of our work.</p>
<p>Whether the job is big or small, we will consult with our client to ensure we meet their expectation, needs and budget outcomes. We have excellent relationships with consultants, subcontractors and suppliers to ensure a high quality of work is carried across all trades.</p>
<a href="/contact-us" class="button primary reveal-icon" >
		<span>Contact Us</span>
	<i class="icon-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>

		</div>
					</div>

	
</div>
	<div id="gap-1546180531" class="gap-element clearfix" style="display:block; height:auto;">
		
