	<div id="col-594285373" class="col medium-6 small-12 large-6"  >
				<div class="col-inner dark"  >
			
			
	<div id="text-3634755558" class="text">
		
<h2>Meet the Founder, <span class="lightblue">Ben</span>.</h2>
		
<style>
#text-3634755558 {
  font-size: 1.4rem;
}
@media (min-width:550px) {
  #text-3634755558 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
  }
}
@media (min-width:850px) {
  #text-3634755558 {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
  }
}
</style>
	</div>
	
<p>I started out building in Wellington/Kapiti Coast in 2002 and continued after moving to Christchurch in 2006. Over the course of my career I have gained skills in different areas of the construction industry such as renovations, architectural housing, light commercial/shop fitouts and general maintenance, as well as extensive experience in project management, managing staff and health and safety compliance.</p>
<p>In 2010 I joined the Licensed Building Practitioner scheme and now hold licences in both carpentry and site classes.</p>
<p>With almost 20 years’ experience in the industry and a wide subset of skills, you can feel assured your next building, renovation or even minor maintenance job will be in great hands. As a Professional Experienced Christchurch Builder, I believe you will be impressed with the whole process – from consent to completion – the results will speak for themselves.</p>
		</div>
					</div>

	
</div>
